# Upload CSM2 PSMCT16 CLUT B at CBP=128 (`0x80`), DSAX=16 (`COU=1`), DSAY=1 (`COV=1`): entry 1 at (17,1) = BLUE (`0xFC00` -> `[0,0,0xF8,0xB0]`)
